msgstr "Ierīce: nevienai Cacti ierīcei nav šāda ID."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Device: another BMC is already mapped to this device."
msgstr "Ierīce: ar šo ierīci jau ir sasaistīts cits BMC."

