#, php-format
msgid "Redfish Credential: %s"
msgstr "Redfish akreditācijas dati: %s"

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "A BMC account with the ReadOnly role. The plugin never needs a role that can change BMC state."
msgstr "BMC konts ar ReadOnly lomu. Spraudnim nekad nav nepieciešama loma, kas var mainīt BMC stāvokli."

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "A password is stored. Leave blank to keep it."
msgstr "Parole ir saglabāta. Atstājiet tukšu, lai to nemainītu."

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "Stored encrypted with the vault key."
msgstr "Saglabāta šifrētā veidā ar glabātuves atslēgu."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are not installed completely. Reinstall them from the Redfish BMCs page."
msgstr "Redfish veidnes nav pilnībā instalētas. Pārinstalējiet tās no lapas \"Redfish BMC\"."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "A device \"%s\" from the %s device template, polled by poller %d, with availability checks off. Its host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Ierīce \"%s\" no ierīces veidnes %s, kuru aptaujā aptaujātājs %d ar izslēgtām pieejamības pārbaudēm. Tās resursdatora nosaukums ir rezervēts nosaukums, ar kuru nekad netiek veidots savienojums."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The data query \"%s\", with a graph for each of the %d members known now."
msgstr "Datu vaicājums \"%s\" ar grafiku katram no %d pašlaik zināmajiem elementiem."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d fans or power supplies that were present are no longer reported. They count as failed until you confirm; confirming accepts the members the BMC reports now."
msgstr "%d ventilatori vai barošanas bloki, kas iepriekš pastāvēja, vairs netiek ziņoti. Tie tiek uzskatīti par bojātiem, līdz apstiprināt izmaiņas; apstiprinot tiks pieņemti elementi, kurus BMC ziņo pašlaik."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The graph \"%s\", with its \"%s\" data source."
msgstr "Grafiks \"%s\" ar tā datu avotu \"%s\"."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The BMC is already mapped to a device."
msgstr "Šis BMC jau ir sasaistīts ar ierīci."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "Created by the Redfish plugin for BMC %s. Its values come from the plugin cache; the host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Izveidoja spraudnis Redfish priekš BMC %s. Tā vērtības nāk no spraudņa kešatmiņas; resursdatora nosaukums ir rezervēts nosaukums, ar kuru nekad netiek veidots savienojums."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "Cacti refused to create the device. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Cacti atteicās izveidot ierīci. Skatiet Cacti žurnālu."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The new device would be hidden from you by your device permissions, so it was removed again. Ask an administrator to grant access, or map the BMC to a device you can see."
msgstr "Jūsu ierīču atļaujas slēptu jauno ierīci no jums, tāpēc tā tika dzēsta. Lūdziet administratoram piešķirt piekļuvi vai sasaistiet BMC ar ierīci, kuru redzat."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The BMC was mapped to a device by someone else meanwhile, or could not be mapped, so the new device was removed again. Reload the page and check its mapping."
msgstr "Pa to laiku kāds cits sasaistīja BMC ar ierīci vai to nevarēja sasaistīt, tāpēc jaunā ierīce tika dzēsta. Pārlādējiet lapu un pārbaudiet sasaisti."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Redfish templates could not be installed: %s"
msgstr "Nevarēja instalēt Redfish veidnes: %s"

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are not installed or not current. Reinstall them from the Redfish BMCs page."
msgstr "Redfish veidnes nav instalētas vai nav aktuālas. Pārinstalējiet tās no lapas \"Redfish BMC\"."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: its Cacti device was deleted. Map it to another device or create one from the BMCs page."
msgstr "%s: šī BMC Cacti ierīce ir dzēsta. Sasaistiet to ar citu ierīci vai izveidojiet jaunu lapā \"Redfish BMC\"."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: its device is polled by poller %d but the BMC is read by poller %d. Move one of them so both use the same poller, or its graphs can read as unknown."
msgstr "%s: ierīci aptaujā aptaujātājs %d, bet BMC nolasa aptaujātājs %d. Pārvietojiet vienu no tiem, lai abi izmantotu to pašu aptaujātāju, pretējā gadījumā grafikos var rādīties nezināmas vērtības."

#: lib/GraphLinks.php
msgid "Redfish graphs of this device"
msgstr "Šīs ierīces Redfish grafiki"

